      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "type": "text",
      "x": 472,
      "y": 992,
      "width": 264,
      "height": 75,
      "text": "MY SURAHS is the spine of the app.\nEach row = an independent memory track\nwith its own schedule. Pausing is a\nfirst-class action, not an abandonment —\ncasual learners cycle in and out.",
