      "width": 277.20000000000005,
      "height": 120,
      "text": "Picking a surah is a COMMITMENT, not a\nbrowse. Tapping '+' opens a short confirm:\nestimated days to memorize at your pace,\nand what it does to your daily load.\n\nThis is the guardrail against collecting\nsurahs you never finish — the #1 failure\nmode for casual learners.",
