      "versionNonce": 56972576,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1162,
      "y": 4922,
      "width": 297,
      "height": 165,
      "text": "FORGIVENESS LADDER (v2-D08)\nA failed gate re-arms for the next day and\nincrements gateFails. After repeated fails\nthe app OFFERS to send the ayah back to\nLearn — the learner accepts, it is never\nforced.\n\nPost-lapse stability is DAMPED (×0.4), never\nzeroed. Sabr jameel: losing a week of work to\none bad morning is the thing that makes\npeople quit.",
      "originalText": "FORGIVENESS LADDER (v2-D08)\nA failed gate re-arms for the next day and\nincrements gateFails. After repeated fails\nthe app OFFERS to send the ayah back to\nLearn — the learner accepts, it is never\nforced.\n\nPost-lapse stability is DAMPED (×0.4), never\nzeroed. Sabr jameel: losing a week of work to\none bad morning is the thing that makes\npeople quit.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
