      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1012,
      "y": 5632,
      "width": 297,
      "height": 180,
      "text": "INVARIANT #4 IS THE MOST IMPORTANT ONE.\n\n'Spacing measured between retrievals, never\napp-opens' is what separates an honest SRS\nfrom a streak-farming app. Opening the app is\nnot learning. Only a graded retrieval moves\nthe clock.\n\nAnd damping massed successes ×0.35 means\ncramming the same ayah ten times in one\nsitting is worth roughly three spaced reps —\nnot ten. The engine refuses to be gamed.",
      "originalText": "INVARIANT #4 IS THE MOST IMPORTANT ONE.\n\n'Spacing measured between retrievals, never\napp-opens' is what separates an honest SRS\nfrom a streak-farming app. Opening the app is\nnot learning. Only a graded retrieval moves\nthe clock.\n\nAnd damping massed successes ×0.35 means\ncramming the same ayah ten times in one\nsitting is worth roughly three spaced reps —\nnot ten. The engine refuses to be gamed.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
