      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "type": "text",
      "x": 472,
      "y": 6502,
      "width": 303.6,
      "height": 120,
      "text": "TARGET METRIC (from tiktok-discussion.md)\n  P(recalled in 10 years) — NOT DAU.\n  'Maximize successful retrievals per minute.'\n\nThe event log is what makes this measurable\nlater: every graded retrieval is labelled,\ntimestamped, and attributable to an atom. That\ndataset is the moat, not the quiz UI.",
      "originalText": "TARGET METRIC (from tiktok-discussion.md)\n  P(recalled in 10 years) — NOT DAU.\n  'Maximize successful retrievals per minute.'\n\nThe event log is what makes this measurable\nlater: every graded retrieval is labelled,\ntimestamped, and attributable to an atom. That\ndataset is the moat, not the quiz UI.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
