      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "type": "text",
      "x": 852,
      "y": 6072,
      "width": 303.6,
      "height": 195,
      "text": "MULTI-SURAH CHANGES THE MONITORING\nThis is the one place v3 genuinely extends v2\nrather than porting it.\n\nWith N surahs there are N independent decay\ncurves competing for one daily budget. The\nProgress page needs a per-surah breakdown AND\na combined load view — otherwise a learner\nadds a third surah and silently starves the\nfirst two.\n\nThe dashboard's 'Add' confirm (§2) is the\nplace to surface that cost BEFORE they commit.",
      "originalText": "MULTI-SURAH CHANGES THE MONITORING\nThis is the one place v3 genuinely extends v2\nrather than porting it.\n\nWith N surahs there are N independent decay\ncurves competing for one daily budget. The\nProgress page needs a per-surah breakdown AND\na combined load view — otherwise a learner\nadds a third surah and silently starves the\nfirst two.\n\nThe dashboard's 'Add' confirm (§2) is the\nplace to surface that cost BEFORE they commit.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "el-625",
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#ba7517",
      "backgroundColor": "#faeeda",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "dashed",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": {
        "type": 3
      },
      "seed": 4957294,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 65560354,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
