      "y": 6956,
      "width": 742.5000000000001,
      "height": 22.5,
      "text": "E-01  ATOM KEY COLLISION — hard blocker, fix before ANY second surah exists",
      "originalText": "E-01  ATOM KEY COLLISION — hard blocker, fix before ANY second surah exists",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "el-632",
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1f1e1b",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 5012727,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 66293457,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "type": "text",
      "x": 100,
      "y": 6988,
      "width": 757.9000000000001,
      "height": 32.5,
      "text": "atomKey(kind, ref) = `${kind}:${ref}`  —  engine/src/atom.ts:69.  AtomState has NO surah field.\nrebuildAtoms() reads EVERY event (db/atoms.ts) and folds them into ONE map. rebuild() never reads e.surah.",
      "originalText": "atomKey(kind, ref) = `${kind}:${ref}`  —  engine/src/atom.ts:69.  AtomState has NO surah field.\nrebuildAtoms() reads EVERY event (db/atoms.ts) and folds them into ONE map. rebuild() never reads e.surah.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "el-633",
      "angle": 0,
