      "width": 429.00000000000006,
      "height": 18.75,
      "text": "⇒ Yusuf ayah 5 and Al-Mulk ayah 5 are THE SAME ATOM.",
      "originalText": "⇒ Yusuf ayah 5 and Al-Mulk ayah 5 are THE SAME ATOM.",
