      "locked": false,
      "type": "text",
      "x": 100,
      "y": 7066,
      "width": 706.2,
      "height": 30,
      "text": "Reviewing one credits the other. Strength, gates and due-dates all silently merge.\nInvisible in v2 because v2 ships one surah. The event log already carries `surah` — only the FOLD is blind.",
      "originalText": "Reviewing one credits the other. Strength, gates and due-dates all silently merge.\nInvisible in v2 because v2 ships one surah. The event log already carries `surah` — only the FOLD is blind.",
      "fontSize": 12,
