      "locked": false,
      "type": "text",
      "x": 100,
      "y": 7112,
      "width": 844.8000000000001,
      "height": 30,
      "text": "FIX: surah rides the key → `${surah}:${kind}:${ref}`, plus a `surah` field on AtomState. Do it in the port (step 4), not later —\nonce a learner has two surahs of history, a corrupted log cannot be un-merged by replaying it.",
      "originalText": "FIX: surah rides the key → `${surah}:${kind}:${ref}`, plus a `surah` field on AtomState. Do it in the port (step 4), not later —\nonce a learner has two surahs of history, a corrupted log cannot be un-merged by replaying it.",
