      "type": "text",
      "x": 892,
      "y": 10172,
      "width": 297,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "PAGE DATA — BLOCKER CLEARED 2026-08-10\nThe geometry is fetched, validated and saved:\nv3/docs/data/yusuf-geometry.json (111/111).\n\nYusuf = pages 235–248 (14 pages), median 8\nayat/page, range 4–11. Juz 12–13, hizb 24–25.\nCross-checked against the independent\n/verses/by_page/236 endpoint — exact match.\n\nSee §13c for the 4-step recipe.",
      "originalText": "PAGE DATA — BLOCKER CLEARED 2026-08-10\nThe geometry is fetched, validated and saved:\nv3/docs/data/yusuf-geometry.json (111/111).\n\nYusuf = pages 235–248 (14 pages), median 8\nayat/page, range 4–11. Juz 12–13, hizb 24–25.\nCross-checked against the independent\n/verses/by_page/236 endpoint — exact match.\n\nSee §13c for the 4-step recipe.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
