      "locked": false,
      "type": "text",
      "x": 136,
      "y": 10646,
      "width": 484.00000000000006,
      "height": 55,
      "text": "\"Add page_number to the compiler fetch\" — but buildCorpus.ts DOESN'T FETCH.\nIt maps over a static file: data/yusuf-verses.json, read by io.ts:34.\nThat file has only { verse_number, text_uthmani, words[] } — no geometry at all.\nSo the fix is upstream of the compiler, in the DATA, not in the fetch.",
      "originalText": "\"Add page_number to the compiler fetch\" — but buildCorpus.ts DOESN'T FETCH.\nIt maps over a static file: data/yusuf-verses.json, read by io.ts:34.\nThat file has only { verse_number, text_uthmani, words[] } — no geometry at all.\nSo the fix is upstream of the compiler, in the DATA, not in the fetch.",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
