      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 7071667,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 93522997,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "type": "text",
      "x": 812,
      "y": 10740,
      "width": 297,
      "height": 180,
      "text": "WHAT CAME FREE\nThe same call also returns juz_number,\nhizb_number, rub_el_hizb_number, ruku_number\nand manzil_number per verse.\n\nEach is another ready-made daily unit for the\n§13 picker and the §14 calendar — 'one hizb a\nweek' is a very common hifz rhythm. Yusuf\nspans juz 12–13, hizb 24–25.\n\nNo extra work: add them to the same enrich\nstep and the picker gains units for free.",
      "originalText": "WHAT CAME FREE\nThe same call also returns juz_number,\nhizb_number, rub_el_hizb_number, ruku_number\nand manzil_number per verse.\n\nEach is another ready-made daily unit for the\n§13 picker and the §14 calendar — 'one hizb a\nweek' is a very common hifz rhythm. Yusuf\nspans juz 12–13, hizb 24–25.\n\nNo extra work: add them to the same enrich\nstep and the picker gains units for free.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
