      "locked": false,
      "type": "text",
      "x": 812,
      "y": 11162,
      "width": 303.6,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "OFFLINE FALLBACK (if the API is ever down\nor rate-limits a big recompile)\nThe geometry is 111 integers per surah — it is\nCOMMITTED at v3/docs/data/yusuf-geometry.json,\nso a rebuild never needs the network again.\n\nStatic alternatives exist (quran-meta on npm,\n@quranjs/api) but are unnecessary once the map\nis in the repo. NOTE: urllib gets HTTP 403\nfrom the API — use curl.",
      "originalText": "OFFLINE FALLBACK (if the API is ever down\nor rate-limits a big recompile)\nThe geometry is 111 integers per surah — it is\nCOMMITTED at v3/docs/data/yusuf-geometry.json,\nso a rebuild never needs the network again.\n\nStatic alternatives exist (quran-meta on npm,\n@quranjs/api) but are unnecessary once the map\nis in the repo. NOTE: urllib gets HTTP 403\nfrom the API — use curl.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
