      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "type": "text",
      "x": 822,
      "y": 13852,
      "width": 297,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "Nothing new needs instrumenting. Every\n'derive' row is a fold over latencies ALREADY\nin the event log — the same trick as §10's\nserver-side metrics.\n\nOne caveat: interrupted latencies are\ndiscarded by design (resume.ts). Time-taken\nmust therefore be reported as 'time on task',\nnever wall-clock, or a learner who took a\nphone call looks slower than they were.",
      "originalText": "Nothing new needs instrumenting. Every\n'derive' row is a fold over latencies ALREADY\nin the event log — the same trick as §10's\nserver-side metrics.\n\nOne caveat: interrupted latencies are\ndiscarded by design (resume.ts). Time-taken\nmust therefore be reported as 'time on task',\nnever wall-clock, or a learner who took a\nphone call looks slower than they were.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
