      "text": "★ THE SINGLE MOST IMPORTANT\nMOMENT IN THE FLOW.\n\nA successful blind reconstruction\ninside the first minute — before\nwe have asked for ANYTHING.\n\nMost apps lose users at a signup\nwall or a 7-question quiz placed\nbefore any value exists.",
