      "width": 303.6,
      "height": 135,
      "text": "ANONYMOUS-FIRST IS ALREADY THE BACKEND\nv2-D03 shipped Sanctum auth as anonymous-first\nwith account adoption. So 'recall before\nidentity' is not a new backend requirement —\nit is the FLOW finally matching what the API\nalready supports.\n\nThe account link appears once, quietly, after\nthe first gate is armed.",
      "originalText": "ANONYMOUS-FIRST IS ALREADY THE BACKEND\nv2-D03 shipped Sanctum auth as anonymous-first\nwith account adoption. So 'recall before\nidentity' is not a new backend requirement —\nit is the FLOW finally matching what the API\nalready supports.\n\nThe account link appears once, quietly, after\nthe first gate is armed.",
      "fontSize": 12,
