      "x": 932,
      "y": 18082,
      "width": 297,
      "height": 135,
      "text": "WHERE THIS COULD STILL GO WRONG\nScreen 2 uses Al-Ikhlas — chosen because\nnearly every target user half-knows it. That\nis also its risk: a learner who does NOT know\nit meets failure as their first experience.\n\nMitigation: pass 1 SHOWS the full ayah before\nany recall is asked. Nobody is tested on\nsomething they were never shown.",
