      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "type": "text",
      "x": 636,
      "y": 20452,
      "width": 296.45000000000005,
      "height": 123.75,
      "text": "SUPERSEDES the waqf/donation model.\nThe old copy — \"Free to memorize. Free to keep,\nsame features either way\" — is now FALSE and had\nto change in the same commit.\n\nLifetime ÷ monthly = 25 months (MY) / 20 (intl).\nThat is a real bet on retention: it only pays if\nlearners stay past ~2 years, which IS the product\nthesis. Price it deliberately, not by accident.",
      "originalText": "SUPERSEDES the waqf/donation model.\nThe old copy — \"Free to memorize. Free to keep,\nsame features either way\" — is now FALSE and had\nto change in the same commit.\n\nLifetime ÷ monthly = 25 months (MY) / 20 (intl).\nThat is a real bet on retention: it only pays if\nlearners stay past ~2 years, which IS the product\nthesis. Price it deliberately, not by accident.",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
