      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 14198767,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 187779097,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1072,
      "y": 19252,
      "width": 310.20000000000005,
      "height": 240,
      "text": "A/B TEST FIRST\n1. Hero headline — LOSS-framed (\"You memorized\n   it. Do you still have it?\") vs MECHANISM-\n   framed (\"Keep every surah you memorize\").\n2. Demo ABOVE vs BELOW the mechanism section.\n\nPRIMARY CONVERSION METRIC:\n  demo-qualified starts — visitors who COMPLETE\n  the inline reconstruction AND tap the CTA.\n\nDownstream north star: D1 GATE-PASS RATE of\nonboarded users.\n\nExplicitly NOT: email captures, raw taps,\nsignups. Those reward a landing page that\nlies.",
      "originalText": "A/B TEST FIRST\n1. Hero headline — LOSS-framed (\"You memorized\n   it. Do you still have it?\") vs MECHANISM-\n   framed (\"Keep every surah you memorize\").\n2. Demo ABOVE vs BELOW the mechanism section.\n\nPRIMARY CONVERSION METRIC:\n  demo-qualified starts — visitors who COMPLETE\n  the inline reconstruction AND tap the CTA.\n\nDownstream north star: D1 GATE-PASS RATE of\nonboarded users.\n\nExplicitly NOT: email captures, raw taps,\nsignups. Those reward a landing page that\nlies.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
