      "x": 1072,
      "y": 19912,
      "width": 290.40000000000003,
      "height": 180,
      "text": "CONSISTENCY CHECK — every claim on this page\nis backed by a surface in this wireframe:\n  · demo → §5 quiz loop\n  · overnight gate → §8 scheduling\n  · half-life / decay → §10 monitoring\n  · calendar → §14\n  · structure map → §3 macro panel\n  · EN/MS glosses → v2-D27\n\nNothing here is vapourware. A landing page\nthat promises what the app doesn't do is the\nfastest way to lose this audience.",
      "originalText": "CONSISTENCY CHECK — every claim on this page\nis backed by a surface in this wireframe:\n  · demo → §5 quiz loop\n  · overnight gate → §8 scheduling\n  · half-life / decay → §10 monitoring\n  · calendar → §14\n  · structure map → §3 macro panel\n  · EN/MS glosses → v2-D27\n\nNothing here is vapourware. A landing page\nthat promises what the app doesn't do is the\nfastest way to lose this audience.",
      "fontSize": 12,
