      "locked": false,
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1272,
      "y": 21812,
      "width": 310.20000000000005,
      "height": 135,
      "text": "FRIENDS LIST SORTS ALPHABETICALLY — never by\nstreak. One sort order is the difference\nbetween a companions list and a leaderboard.\n\nAnd the \"no session yet\" marker is a HOLLOW\nMUTED circle, never coral. Coral is reserved\nfor slips; using it for \"hasn't shown up today\"\nwould turn a neighbour's ordinary Tuesday into\na visible failure.",
      "originalText": "FRIENDS LIST SORTS ALPHABETICALLY — never by\nstreak. One sort order is the difference\nbetween a companions list and a leaderboard.\n\nAnd the \"no session yet\" marker is a HOLLOW\nMUTED circle, never coral. Coral is reserved\nfor slips; using it for \"hasn't shown up today\"\nwould turn a neighbour's ordinary Tuesday into\na visible failure.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
