      "type": "text",
      "x": 366,
      "y": 23468,
      "width": 533.5,
      "height": 12.5,
      "text": "A kill fires an alert, bypasses the ramp, and pins a banner until a SECOND admin acknowledges it.",
      "originalText": "A kill fires an alert, bypasses the ramp, and pins a banner until a SECOND admin acknowledges it.",
      "fontSize": 10,
