      "text": "COLOUR DISCIPLINE HOLDS\nOFF renders MUTED, never coral. Coral is\nreserved for errors and harm — using it for\n\"disabled\" would make the safe default look\nbroken and quietly pressure operators to turn\nthings on.\n\nSmall detail, real consequence.",
