      "y": 24396,
      "width": 369.05,
      "height": 13.75,
      "text": "DARK-PATTERN REVIEW GATE — 5 checks, any FAIL blocks approval",
      "originalText": "DARK-PATTERN REVIEW GATE — 5 checks, any FAIL blocks approval",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "el-2258",
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#5f5d55",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 17889021,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 236582811,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "type": "text",
      "x": 366,
      "y": 24416,
      "width": 374.00000000000006,
      "height": 62.5,
      "text": "1  Not loss-framed — no \"don't lose your streak\", no countdown\n2  No guilt or shame language\n3  Respects satiety — never prompts a learner already at today's cap\n4  Honest claim — copy matches what the SRS actually predicts\n5  Silence-positive — has a defined condition where it does NOT send",
      "originalText": "1  Not loss-framed — no \"don't lose your streak\", no countdown\n2  No guilt or shame language\n3  Respects satiety — never prompts a learner already at today's cap\n4  Honest claim — copy matches what the SRS actually predicts\n5  Silence-positive — has a defined condition where it does NOT send",
      "fontSize": 10,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "el-2259",
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#d85a30",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 17896940,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 236687540,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "type": "text",
      "x": 366,
      "y": 24492,
      "width": 187.00000000000003,
      "height": 12.5,
      "text": "The author may NEVER self-approve.",
      "originalText": "The author may NEVER self-approve.",
      "fontSize": 10,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
