      "originalText": "grep for initLadder / nextItem / s1Options / bridgeItems / junctionItem across src/pages, session, db, admin, corpus, components\n→ ZERO app callers. ladder.ts (281 lines, S1/S2/S3), bridge.ts (S4), chain.ts (junction) are UNREACHABLE from the UI.",
