      "x": 140,
      "y": 26840,
      "width": 489.50000000000006,
      "height": 62.5,
      "text": "Admin.tsx:311 ships a free-text {prompt, options[], correct} editor. Laravel validates\n`payload => ['required','array']` and NOTHING inside it. overrides.ts:139 pushes it to\ncustoms[] UNRESOLVED. No renderer reads customs. Rows accumulate — and become learner-\nvisible the instant anyone builds the renderer, retroactively, with no review in between.\nAn admin can type Arabic into `correct` RIGHT NOW and it persists.",
      "originalText": "Admin.tsx:311 ships a free-text {prompt, options[], correct} editor. Laravel validates\n`payload => ['required','array']` and NOTHING inside it. overrides.ts:139 pushes it to\ncustoms[] UNRESOLVED. No renderer reads customs. Rows accumulate — and become learner-\nvisible the instant anyone builds the renderer, retroactively, with no review in between.\nAn admin can type Arabic into `correct` RIGHT NOW and it persists.",
