      "width": 456.50000000000006,
      "height": 37.5,
      "text": "Drill.tsx:203 and Gate.tsx:100 both: `const rung: Rung = item.full ? \"S3\" : \"S2\";`\nInvariant #6 (\"React never decides sequencing\") is ALREADY leaking on the most\nconsequential axis — S3 triggers scheduleGate() and grants GAIN.s3 (30) vs s2 (12).",
      "originalText": "Drill.tsx:203 and Gate.tsx:100 both: `const rung: Rung = item.full ? \"S3\" : \"S2\";`\nInvariant #6 (\"React never decides sequencing\") is ALREADY leaking on the most\nconsequential axis — S3 triggers scheduleGate() and grants GAIN.s3 (30) vs s2 (12).",
