      "text": "Migration 2026_07_16_040001 = unique(surah,ayah) + verified_by + note + created_at.\nA qari signs ayah 5; an admin then writes a gloss override for ayah 5; the row still\nreads verified. The GATE-A \"verified frontier\" metric is provably lying TODAY.",
