      "x": 140,
      "y": 27155,
      "width": 473.00000000000006,
      "height": 37.5,
      "text": "overrides.ts:117 sorts on createdAt alone. Ties resolve by DB row order, which is not\nguaranteed — and the seeder bulk-inserts rows sharing a millisecond. overrides.test.ts\nalready asserts array order shouldn't matter; at ties that intent is unenforced.",
      "originalText": "overrides.ts:117 sorts on createdAt alone. Ties resolve by DB row order, which is not\nguaranteed — and the seeder bulk-inserts rows sharing a millisecond. overrides.test.ts\nalready asserts array order shouldn't matter; at ties that intent is unenforced.",
