      "width": 344.85,
      "height": 82.5,
      "text": "· which words/ayat a question is ABOUT (selector)\n· which foil kernel fills the wrong options + params\n· the prompt text (EN / MS — translation, not revelation)\n· which of 4 render shapes to use\n· a difficulty offset (−1 / 0 / +1)\n· blank policy",
      "originalText": "· which words/ayat a question is ABOUT (selector)\n· which foil kernel fills the wrong options + params\n· the prompt text (EN / MS — translation, not revelation)\n· which of 4 render shapes to use\n· a difficulty offset (−1 / 0 / +1)\n· blank policy",
