      "y": 27536,
      "width": 231.00000000000003,
      "height": 18.75,
      "text": "HARD PROBLEM 1 — FOLD SAFETY",
      "originalText": "HARD PROBLEM 1 — FOLD SAFETY",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "el-2429",
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#5f5d55",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 19243170,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 254491470,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "type": "text",
      "x": 100,
      "y": 27560,
      "width": 332.75,
      "height": 41.25,
      "text": "An append-only log referencing an OPEN, EDITABLE set of\nspec ids, where tonight's fold_determinism_check must\nmatch 100% forever.",
      "originalText": "An append-only log referencing an OPEN, EDITABLE set of\nspec ids, where tonight's fold_determinism_check must\nmatch 100% forever.",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "el-2430",
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#6c5bb8",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 19251089,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 254596199,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "type": "text",
      "x": 100,
      "y": 27614,
      "width": 343.20000000000005,
      "height": 16.25,
      "text": "THE RULE: the fold NEVER dereferences a spec id.",
      "originalText": "THE RULE: the fold NEVER dereferences a spec id.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "el-2431",
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#5f5d55",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 19259008,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 254700928,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "type": "text",
      "x": 100,
      "y": 27638,
      "width": 291.5,
      "height": 162.5,
      "text": "1  `Rung` stays a CLOSED union forever. Specs never\n   extend it. rebuild.ts requires ZERO changes.\n2  The event carries a DENORMALIZED snapshot, not a\n   pointer: gradeClassToWire() resolves to a literal\n   Rung at emit time. Delete every spec tonight — no\n   past fold can change, there is nothing to look up.\n3  Grading is DERIVED FROM OBSERVATION: \"S3\" is\n   returned only when the ENGINE observed full\n   coverage. A one-tap MCQ cannot declare itself S3\n   and forge an encoding event.\n4  origin:\"admin\" specs are clamped to \"ungraded\"\n   server-side → routed to test_* events, for which\n   rebuild.ts deliberately has NO branch (v2-D14).",
      "originalText": "1  `Rung` stays a CLOSED union forever. Specs never\n   extend it. rebuild.ts requires ZERO changes.\n2  The event carries a DENORMALIZED snapshot, not a\n   pointer: gradeClassToWire() resolves to a literal\n   Rung at emit time. Delete every spec tonight — no\n   past fold can change, there is nothing to look up.\n3  Grading is DERIVED FROM OBSERVATION: \"S3\" is\n   returned only when the ENGINE observed full\n   coverage. A one-tap MCQ cannot declare itself S3\n   and forge an encoding event.\n4  origin:\"admin\" specs are clamped to \"ungraded\"\n   server-side → routed to test_* events, for which\n   rebuild.ts deliberately has NO branch (v2-D14).",
      "fontSize": 10,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "el-2432",
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1d9e75",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 19266927,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 254805657,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "type": "text",
      "x": 100,
      "y": 27798,
      "width": 292.05,
      "height": 22.5,
      "text": "This generalizes what reconstruct.ts already does: RC never\nreaches the wire; it stamps its S2/S3 equivalence class.",
      "originalText": "This generalizes what reconstruct.ts already does: RC never\nreaches the wire; it stamps its S2/S3 equivalence class.",
      "fontSize": 9,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "el-2433",
      "angle": 0,
