      "type": "text",
      "x": 790,
      "y": 27536,
      "width": 288.75,
      "height": 18.75,
      "text": "HARD PROBLEM 2 — QURAN AUTHENTICITY",
      "originalText": "HARD PROBLEM 2 — QURAN AUTHENTICITY",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "el-2435",
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#5f5d55",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 19290684,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 255119844,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "type": "text",
      "x": 790,
      "y": 27560,
      "width": 314.6,
      "height": 27.5,
      "text": "It must be impossible for an admin — or a model — to\nintroduce non-authentic Quranic Arabic.",
      "originalText": "It must be impossible for an admin — or a model — to\nintroduce non-authentic Quranic Arabic.",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "el-2436",
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#6c5bb8",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 19298603,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 255224573,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "type": "text",
      "x": 790,
      "y": 27600,
      "width": 386.1,
      "height": 16.25,
      "text": "THE GUARANTEE: a TYPE-LEVEL impossibility, not a rule.",
      "originalText": "THE GUARANTEE: a TYPE-LEVEL impossibility, not a rule.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "el-2437",
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#5f5d55",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 19306522,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 255329302,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "type": "text",
      "x": 790,
      "y": 27624,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "· `CorpusRef` is a 5-variant union of pure COORDINATES:\n  word · verse · gloss · distractor · ayahNumber.\n  There is NO { literal: string } member.\n· Every answer/option slot is a CorpusRef, resolved by\n  the single function resolveRef(corpus, ref) — which\n  can only return bytes already in the compiled corpus.\n· An Arabic `Face` is { text, script:\"arabic\", from }\n  with `from` MANDATORY — only constructible by a kernel\n  that actually read the corpus at that coordinate.\n  Provenance is PRODUCED, not claimed.\n· A test asserts resolveRef(corpus, face.from) === face.text\n  for every Face across a full-corpus sweep.",
      "originalText": "· `CorpusRef` is a 5-variant union of pure COORDINATES:\n  word · verse · gloss · distractor · ayahNumber.\n  There is NO { literal: string } member.\n· Every answer/option slot is a CorpusRef, resolved by\n  the single function resolveRef(corpus, ref) — which\n  can only return bytes already in the compiled corpus.\n· An Arabic `Face` is { text, script:\"arabic\", from }\n  with `from` MANDATORY — only constructible by a kernel\n  that actually read the corpus at that coordinate.\n  Provenance is PRODUCED, not claimed.\n· A test asserts resolveRef(corpus, face.from) === face.text\n  for every Face across a full-corpus sweep.",
      "fontSize": 10,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "el-2438",
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1d9e75",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 19314441,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 255434031,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "type": "text",
      "x": 790,
      "y": 27788,
      "width": 301.95000000000005,
      "height": 33.75,
      "text": "\"There is no field in the entire schema, at any depth, typed\n`string`, that renders as Arabic. A field that does not exist\nneeds no validator and cannot drift between TS and PHP.\"",
      "originalText": "\"There is no field in the entire schema, at any depth, typed\n`string`, that renders as Arabic. A field that does not exist\nneeds no validator and cannot drift between TS and PHP.\"",
      "fontSize": 9,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "el-2439",
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1f1e1b",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 19322360,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 255538760,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "type": "text",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 27852,
      "width": 412.50000000000006,
      "height": 18.75,
      "text": "THE RENDER CONTRACT — 4 shapes, closed PERMANENTLY",
      "originalText": "THE RENDER CONTRACT — 4 shapes, closed PERMANENTLY",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "el-2440",
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#918f86",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 19330279,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 255643489,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "type": "text",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 27874,
      "width": 683.6500000000001,
      "height": 13.75,
      "text": "Specs are open; shapes are not. A spec picks WHICH shape and WHAT data fills it — it can never introduce a fifth.",
      "originalText": "Specs are open; shapes are not. A spec picks WHICH shape and WHAT data fills it — it can never introduce a fifth.",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
