      "height": 27.5,
      "text": "This is why \"a junction spans TWO ayat but specs bind to ONE\" never becomes a problem: the seam IS a coordinate.\nInvariant #1 is untouched — atoms stay per-ayah and per-connection. rebuild.ts's junction_result branch is unchanged.",
