      "seed": 20557724,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 271876484,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "type": "text",
      "x": 100,
      "y": 30020,
      "width": 308,
      "height": 125,
      "text": "Every design DERIVED a visit counter by folding the log.\nAll three break, and I verified why:\n\n  db/eventLog.ts:113  mergeFromServer does\n      const { seq: _drop, ...rest } = e\n  so IndexedDB assigns a FRESH local seq.\n\n⇒ log order is ARRIVAL order. Two devices with\nbyte-identical event sets select DIFFERENT questions.\n`ts` can't rescue it (clock skew, ms ties).",
      "originalText": "Every design DERIVED a visit counter by folding the log.\nAll three break, and I verified why:\n\n  db/eventLog.ts:113  mergeFromServer does\n      const { seq: _drop, ...rest } = e\n  so IndexedDB assigns a FRESH local seq.\n\n⇒ log order is ARRIVAL order. Two devices with\nbyte-identical event sets select DIFFERENT questions.\n`ts` can't rescue it (clock skew, ms ties).",
      "fontSize": 10,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
