      "type": "text",
      "x": 790,
      "y": 30020,
      "width": 308,
      "height": 125,
      "text": "Stamp `siteKey` + `visitOrdinal` onto the event AT EMIT.\nNext ordinal = max(recorded for siteKey) + 1.\n\nCommutative and set-monotone ⇒ immune to arrival\norder, immune to a late sync, immune to getAll()\nreturning [] on a wedged IndexedDB.\n\nExactly the denormalization pattern gradeClassToWire()\nalready uses for Rung. Selection becomes a WRITTEN\nFACT — a bug report replays from the log alone.",
      "originalText": "Stamp `siteKey` + `visitOrdinal` onto the event AT EMIT.\nNext ordinal = max(recorded for siteKey) + 1.\n\nCommutative and set-monotone ⇒ immune to arrival\norder, immune to a late sync, immune to getAll()\nreturning [] on a wedged IndexedDB.\n\nExactly the denormalization pattern gradeClassToWire()\nalready uses for Rung. Selection becomes a WRITTEN\nFACT — a bug report replays from the log alone.",
      "fontSize": 10,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
