      "type": "text",
      "x": 100,
      "y": 30288,
      "width": 654.5,
      "height": 25,
      "text": "lapPerm hash-permutes the L lanes per lap ⇒ every lane fires EXACTLY ONCE per lap (no starvation, structurally),\nwhile lap ORDER differs every lap (variety). stride(N) computed in INTEGER arithmetic — no float on the selection path.",
      "originalText": "lapPerm hash-permutes the L lanes per lap ⇒ every lane fires EXACTLY ONCE per lap (no starvation, structurally),\nwhile lap ORDER differs every lap (variety). stride(N) computed in INTEGER arithmetic — no float on the selection path.",
