      "width": 456.50000000000006,
      "height": 37.5,
      "text": "|Set(normalize(option))| === optionCount. Promotes ladder.ts's load-bearing `seen`\nSet into the admissibility metric. Byte equality is NOT enough: 12:37 p10 \"[that]\"\nvs p12 \"That\" are indistinguishable to a reader. Normalizing catches 11 more slots.",
