      "x": 136,
      "y": 35824,
      "width": 459.8,
      "height": 27.5,
      "text": "atomKey = `${surah}:${kind}:${ref}` + surah on AtomState. Zero UI.\nThe one decision every later step folds through — settle it before any code.",
