    },
    {
      "id": "el-3053",
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#712b13",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 24184626,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 319842366,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "type": "text",
      "x": 772,
      "y": 35802,
      "width": 303.6,
      "height": 180,
      "text": "WHY E-01 IS STEP 1\nIt is a SCHEMA decision, not a feature. The\nevent log (3), the corpus loader (4) and every\nfold in the engine (5) are written against it.\n\nSettle the key shape before any of them exist\nand the fix is ~20 lines. Settle it after a\nlearner has two surahs of history and it is a\ndata migration over a log whose atoms have\nalready merged ambiguously.\n\nStep 1 ships no UI. That is the point.",
      "originalText": "WHY E-01 IS STEP 1\nIt is a SCHEMA decision, not a feature. The\nevent log (3), the corpus loader (4) and every\nfold in the engine (5) are written against it.\n\nSettle the key shape before any of them exist\nand the fix is ~20 lines. Settle it after a\nlearner has two surahs of history and it is a\ndata migration over a log whose atoms have\nalready merged ambiguously.\n\nStep 1 ships no UI. That is the point.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "el-3054",
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#ba7517",
      "backgroundColor": "#faeeda",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "dashed",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": {
        "type": 3
      },
      "seed": 24192545,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 319947095,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
