      "type": "text",
      "x": 772,
      "y": 37312,
      "width": 297,
      "height": 135,
      "text": "REUSE FROM v2 (do not rewrite)\n  · engine/ — strength, decay, scheduling\n  · corpus.json — 111 ayat, 1777 words\n  · iman-ui.css — the locked design system\n  · the append-only event log pattern\n\nv3 is a new SHELL around a proven core, not a\nnew engine. The ONLY engine changes are the\nsurah-scoping fixes in §11.",
      "originalText": "REUSE FROM v2 (do not rewrite)\n  · engine/ — strength, decay, scheduling\n  · corpus.json — 111 ayat, 1777 words\n  · iman-ui.css — the locked design system\n  · the append-only event log pattern\n\nv3 is a new SHELL around a proven core, not a\nnew engine. The ONLY engine changes are the\nsurah-scoping fixes in §11.",
